    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45849" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sub-ērĭgo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				ectum, 3, v. a., <i>to
				raise up</i> from below (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Isthmon curvata sublime suberigit unda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					15, 155</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">effultus in cubitum suberectusque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 123 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Marc. Emp. 20</span></i>.</div>
